{"abstract":"We, the National Marine Fisheries Service (NMFS), issue this final rule to designate critical habitat for the Beringia distinct population segment (DPS) of the Pacific bearded seal subspecies Erignathus barbatus nauticus under the Endangered Species Act (ESA). The critical habitat designation comprises an area of marine habitat in the Bering, Chukchi, and Beaufort seas.","action":"Final rule.","agencies":[{"id":54,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","name":"Commerce Department","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","slug":"commerce-department","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department"},{"id":361,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/361","name":"National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration","parent_id":54,"raw_name":"National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration","slug":"national-oceanic-and-atmospheric-administration","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/national-oceanic-and-atmospheric-administration"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06173.html","cfr_references":[{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"223","title":50},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"226","title":50}],"citation":"87 FR 19180","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"This rule is effective May 2, 2022.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Docket No. 220318-0073"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06173","effective_on":"2022-05-02","end_page":19230,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06173.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06173/endangered-and-threatened-species-designation-of-critical-habitat-for-the-beringia-distinct","images":{"ER01AP22.000":{"large":"https://img.federalregister.gov/ER01AP22.00